        <mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;WMSD — Core Data Model&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;22 selected collections from the current 61-collection MongoDB runtime · logical application references, not database-enforced foreign keys&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#17324D;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=14;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=22;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="20" width="1990" height="92" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scope_note" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading the diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PK = collection _id (ObjectId, or DocumentIdentity for coded documents); FK = Mongoose ref / application-level link; [] = embedded array, not a collection. Cardinality labels are shown beside Crow's-foot markers.&lt;br/&gt;New sales orders keep customer name/phone snapshots; no Customer catalogue relationship is shown. goods_receipts is one collection with five documentKind variants. Cancelled PO links remain in sources[]; at most one active PO per request. IN_TRANSIT stock points have dispatchLineId and no locationId." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F8FA;strokeColor=#CBD2D9;fontColor=#263238;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1280" width="1990" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
